 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They brought the ark of God inside the tent",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "David had pitched it for the covenant",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Before God they offered burnt offerings",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And peace offerings for the nation",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the work was done he blessed the people",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In the name of the Lord most high",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To every man and woman in Israel",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave bread meat and raisin cake",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Give thanks to the LORD call on his name",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Make known among the nations what he has done",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Sing to him sing praise to him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tell of all his wonderful works",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He appointed Asaph and the Levites",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To minister before the ark of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "With harps and lyres they played the music",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While trumpets sounded out his word",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Give thanks to the LORD call on his name",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Make known among the nations what he has done",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sing to him sing praise to him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tell of all his wonderful works",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remember his covenant forever",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The word he commanded for a thousand generations",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is the LORD our God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His judgments fill the whole earth",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "David returned home to bless his household",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
